If the platform is iOS, we request location permission using the `PermissionsIOS.requestPermission` method and pass in the permission that we want to request (`LOCATION_WHEN_IN_USE` in this case). If the user grants permission, we log a message to indicate that the permission has been granted. If the user denies permission, we log a message to indicate that the permission has been denied.

